sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as Admin / Data Scientist
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API Server<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS1.2+
    participant DSPA as DSPAReconciler<br/>(controller-runtime)
    participant Manifests as Manifestival Engine
    participant TLSWatch as SecurityProfileWatcher
    participant APIServer as OpenShift APIServer CR

    Note over Admin,APIServer: DSPA Reconciliation Flow

    Admin->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply DSPA CR<br/>Auth: kubeconfig/ServiceAccount
    K8sAPI->>DSPA: Watch event: DSPA created/updated<br/>mTLS ServiceAccount token

    activate DSPA
    DSPA->>K8sAPI: Read DSPA spec + status<br/>GET datasciencepipelinesapplications
    K8sAPI-->>DSPA: DSPA object

    DSPA->>Manifests: Render templates from config/internal/
    Manifests-->>DSPA: Rendered manifests

    par Deploy Owned Resources
        DSPA->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Argo Workflow CRDs<br/>(Workflow, CronWorkflow, WorkflowTemplate, ...)
        DSPA->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Pipeline API Server Deployment
        DSPA->>K8sAPI: Create/Update ConfigMaps & Secrets<br/>(DB config, storage config)
        DSPA->>K8sAPI: Create/Update RBAC<br/>(Roles, RoleBindings, ServiceAccounts)
        DSPA->>K8sAPI: Create/Update NetworkPolicies
        DSPA->>K8sAPI: Create/Update OpenShift Routes
        DSPA->>K8sAPI: Create/Update ServiceMonitors
    end

    DSPA->>K8sAPI: Update DSPA status<br/>PATCH datasciencepipelinesapplications/status
    deactivate DSPA

    Note over Admin,APIServer: Platform Integration Watches

    DSPA->>K8sAPI: Watch MLflow CRs<br/>GET mlflows.mlflow.opendatahub.io
    K8sAPI-->>DSPA: MLflow instance state

    DSPA->>K8sAPI: Watch KServe InferenceServices<br/>GET inferenceservices.serving.kserve.io
    K8sAPI-->>DSPA: Model serving state

    DSPA->>K8sAPI: CRUD Kubeflow Notebooks<br/>kubeflow.org resources
    K8sAPI-->>DSPA: Notebook workbench state

    Note over Admin,APIServer: Metrics & Health

    participant Prom as Prometheus
    Prom->>DSPA: Scrape /metrics<br/>Port 8080/TCP HTTP
    DSPA-->>Prom: Prometheus metrics

    participant Kubelet as Kubelet
    Kubelet->>DSPA: GET /healthz<br/>Port 8081/TCP HTTP
    DSPA-->>Kubelet: 200 OK
    Kubelet->>DSPA: GET /readyz<br/>Port 8081/TCP HTTP
    DSPA-->>Kubelet: 200 OK

    Note over Admin,APIServer: TLS Profile Synchronization

    TLSWatch->>APIServer: Watch OpenShift TLS profile<br/>GET apiservers.config.openshift.io
    APIServer-->>TLSWatch: TLS profile (cipher suites, min version)
    TLSWatch->>DSPA: Signal graceful restart<br/>(on profile change)
